      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CREEPING CHOICE (1) was in traffic close to the inside last time over 340m at Bulli and fell. Has good speed and aided by the cherry draw. Rates strongly on best and well worth another try. LIZZIE LONG LEGS (2) missed the frame last time at Bulli but was a Grade 5 winner the start prior (19.28) and goes well this course. Has the ability and can find best this time. FASCINATE ABBY (7) ran good time (22.89) winning a Grade 5 three back at this track but missed the frame latest finishing sixth at Gosford. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from on outside draw. Can improve sharply here. DURAN QUEEN (3) is worth another chance despite missing the top-three here most recently.",
